Today's three mainstream comparisons:
BTC is the strongest, leading the market; 
ETH is average, passively following, with general elasticity; 
BNB is the weakest, struggling to rebound, clearly lagging behind.
Operational idea: focus on BTC, be light on ETH, and do not get attached to BNB.
